### Description

It already has `try_from_path()` and `try_from_pathbuf()`, a natural extension to make this more idiomatic is implementing the `TryFrom` trait.

Something like this, I think

```rust
impl TryFrom<Path> for PlPathRef {
    type Error = PolarsError;

    fn try_from(value: Path) -> Result<Self, Self::Error> {
        PlPathRef::try_from_path(value)
    }
}
```

