**Prettier 3.8.1**
[Playground link on original snippet](https://prettier.io/playground/#-RwlI+ICsOEWgSyMEBnDKNAxnwOShK3CyqS47Dg2I93VgCXUcxgtOQAA4AAxKDJ-dQZR3O11fGkwTjsENhiNIABMSmq4XWmYsadaND9cxhcz8nGO1SdcAAYqMXUTypiyRAQBIJEA)
[Playground link on output](https://prettier.io/playground/#-mwSuQ0e89goihwMsl2Cw4Ji3Z1YHFVDMYNTkAAOAAMCjSP1UaXtjudHypMDYLCDIbDSAATApKqFVumzCnmuQfTMoTMfGxDpUHXAAGLDJ0E0rokkQECiURAA)

**Input:**
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
```jsx
{
  foo: (
    // comment
    {
      bar: "baz",
    }
  )
}
```

**Output:**
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
```jsx
{
  foo: // comment
  ({
    bar: "baz",
  });
}
```

**Rerun on output:**
```jsx
{
  // comment
  foo: ({
    bar: "baz",
  }) as const;
}
```

**Expected output:**

I would expect the input to directly format to the second output which is stable instead of having an extra step.

I have searched for similar issues like #2392, #11665, but it's difficult for an outsider to know if it's the same, so I prefer to report.

