**Prettier 3.9.6**
[Playground link](https://prettier.io/playground/#N4Igxg9gdgLgprEAuEABAtnAJgSwIYAEqweAvgcADpQG0EB0hVNdtkANhAE5IFfYBuaq1LVSIADQgIABxg5oAZ2Sg8XLhADuABTUJlKPO014AnsqkAjLnjABrODADKeTABkcUOMgBmRxXBSEJYAVnBgMADqNjLIIDL8AVwAbt5WNvaOTjK2ngDmyDBcAK6BIAHoOIUlZXAAHjJwXDiYsEYA8o02MNzaEIo48tBxCFiSIPVdLQgwRgAqTVBqOHAGfuwBUgNQeexwAIrFEPC+-)

**Input:**

```less
@media @{a} {
    .a {
      color: red;
    }
}
```

**Unexpected Error:**
```
SyntaxError: CssSyntaxError: Unknown word breakpoint-regular (13:18)
```

**Why?**

using `@a` less now prints a deprecation error:

```
DEPRECATED WARNING: A bare @variable in an at-rule prelude is deprecated. Use @{variable} interpolation instead.
```

using `@{a}` prettier gives a error.

